<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuntlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">boran</unclear>, ersamen weisen lieben
<lb n="2"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>. Unns ist ain schreyben verschiner tag
<lb n="3"/>von unnsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freunden</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-342" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Freyburg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Breyßgow</unclear></placeName> zue-
<lb n="4"/>komen, wie ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vß</unclear> inligender schrifft zuevernemen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uff</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schreiben</unclear> wir nach dem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-132" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Breyen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrachtet</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="6"/>alß in unnser venckhnuß gebracht. Der dann unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unge</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/>sprochen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekennt</unclear>, wie hieby <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vß</unclear> der abschrifft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergicht</unclear> zuevernemen. Unnd dieweyl er dann unns be-
<lb n="9"/>richt gethon, das er umb <persName resp="#ner">Mischaelis</persName> negstuerschinen
<lb n="10"/>in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uwer</unclear> statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear>, und biß ungeuar <date resp="#ner">vier woch vor
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vaßnachten</unclear></date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhartt</unclear>, so bittn
<lb n="12"/>wir vch nachpuerlich, ir wolt der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerechtigkait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stür</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kundtschafft</unclear> daruff machn, ob gedachter <placeName resp="#ner">Brey</placeName>
<lb n="14"/>sölche zeyt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewesen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ud</unclear> ob er ainen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fueß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkhuelht</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>hab, unnd unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselben</unclear> by disem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnserm</unclear> bottenn
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verstendign</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stett</unclear> unns nachpürlich umb vch zuebeschuldn.
<lb n="17"/>Datm <origDate when="1551" resp="#ner">den xij february ao 1551</origDate>.
<lb n="18"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Hans <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Montprat</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Spiegelberg</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">roem</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kü</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>.
<lb n="19"/>statthalter der hauptmanschafft, auch <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-56" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">burg-
<lb n="20"/>maister und rath der statt Costanntz</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_691_1666.JPG" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_691_1667.JPG" n="3"/>
<lb n="21"/>Unser fruntlich willig dinst zuvor. Es hatt umb nechstver
<lb n="22"/>schinen <date resp="#ner">Sannt Jhoergen tag</date> ainer <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Boerle</persName> genannt,
<lb n="23"/>ain weber, der ewer burger sein solle, alhie in unserer
<lb n="24"/>statt unnd ouch in unserer oberkait zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Kirchzartn</placeName> gegen
<lb n="25"/>unserem angehoerigen daselbs, <persName resp="#ner">Wolffen Jentzen</persName>, rede wort
<lb n="26"/>usßgeschlagen, er welle dem selben Wolffen ain rotten hanen
<lb n="27"/>uff sein huß setzen, unnd ain spiel ime zuorichtn, das
<lb n="28"/>er die hend ob dem kopff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesamen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schlagen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muesßte</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nun</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>hat sich laider seydher bey etlichn wochen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angenochtn</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>zuogetragen, das dem selben <persName resp="#ner">Wolff Jentzn</persName> und an
<lb n="31"/>dern unsern angehoerigen zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Kirchzartn</placeName> ire heuser
<lb n="32"/>und schuiren schedlichen verbrunnen, welchs
<lb n="33"/>aller anzaigk unnd glegenhait nach von ingelegtem
<lb n="34"/>fewen beschehen, deßhalben uff ainen der sich
<lb n="35"/><persName resp="#ner">Jacob Strawlin</persName> von <placeName resp="#ner">Rinfelden</placeName> nennt unnd ouch ain
<lb n="36"/>weber ist, ouch desselben hußfrow unnd stieffdochter,
<lb n="37"/>die sich ain zytlang daselbs zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Kirchzartn</placeName> muessig geend
<lb n="38"/>erhaltn unnd in der brunst etwas verdechtig
<lb n="39"/>erzaigt, der argwon und verdacht gefallen, das sy
<lb n="40"/>daran schuldig seygend, derwegen in unser verhaff=
<lb n="41"/>tung und gefengknuß komen, in welcher ge-
<lb n="42"/>dachter <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Strawlin</persName>, alß wir ine der gycht nach
<lb n="43"/>gefragt, bekhendt, das vorgenannter <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Boerle</persName>
<lb n="44"/>ewer burger, der sich ainmal von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Costanntz</placeName>, das and
<lb n="45"/>mal von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt Gallen</placeName>, und etwan von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-57" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Waldßhuot</placeName>
<lb n="46"/>nenne, unnd des selben gsel <persName resp="#ner">Hannß</persName> uß dem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Tur=
<lb n="47"/>goew</placeName>, zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Husen am Rhein</placeName> uff dem veld zuo ime
<lb n="48"/>komen, ime drey thaler geben, das er gen <placeName resp="#ner">Kirchzar=
<lb n="49"/>ten</placeName> gon, daselbs iren wartn, wollen sy ime anzaign
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_691_1668.JPG" n="4"/>
<lb n="50"/>was er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelle</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hernach</unclear> über etlich wochen
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seijgen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> ime in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorgedachten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wolff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nentzen</unclear></persName>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">komen</unclear> hab ime der <persName resp="#ner">Hannß</persName> uß dem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thurgöw</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">acht</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">shilling</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geben</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darbeij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bede</unclear> ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevolhen</unclear>, dem
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgenannten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wolff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nentzen</unclear>, unnd ouch dem vogt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ire</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heuser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueverbrennen</unclear>, es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sige</unclear> ouch der gedacht <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buerle</unclear></persName>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewessen</unclear>, alß er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wolff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nentzen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anztündet</unclear>,
<lb n="57"/>unnd hab ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geholffen</unclear>. Er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bekhenndt</unclear> ouch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> er
<lb n="58"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cunrat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wagners</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kierchhartt</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbrennen</unclear> wellen,
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seijgen</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwen</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buerlin</unclear></persName> unnd <persName resp="#ner">Hannß</persName> uß dem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Turgöw</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewessen</unclear> haben mit ainem grossen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">neper</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">loch</unclear> gegen dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fueter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geboret</unclear>, unnd ain <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">brinnend</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>liecht, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zundt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">strickh</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestossen</unclear>, das
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darvon</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anganngen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbrunnen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">red</unclear> ouch
<lb n="64"/>das der <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buerle</unclear></persName> im <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angzeigt</unclear> es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iren</unclear> sechs die
<lb n="65"/>also <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">brennen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Er</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sagt</unclear> ouch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weijther</unclear>, der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buerle</unclear> hab ime
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolhen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wolff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nentzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> ander hauß ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuever</unclear>-
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brennen</unclear>. Unnd der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemelt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buerle</unclear></persName>, hab ain frow,
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seij</unclear> uß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ewer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statt</unclear> wisse nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annderst</unclear>, dann sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haisse</unclear>
<lb n="69"/><persName resp="#ner">Anna</persName>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> vatter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seij</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kornmesser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewessen</unclear>,
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sitze</unclear> sein <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buerlins</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mhueter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> im <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Siechlinhüßlin</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beij</unclear>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear>. Unnd die frow so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buerle</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ietz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> hab, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seij</unclear>
<lb n="72"/>nit sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehfrow</unclear>, dann die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wer</unclear> sein frow, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seij</unclear> von
<lb n="73"/>im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwicchen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußursach</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> hab <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">übelgschlagen</unclear>, das
