<lb n="75"/>alles <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> im besten, unnd darmit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> dar-
