<lb n="79"/>was wesens <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> wandels der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgenannt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Jacob
<lb n="80"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Boeler</unclear></persName> sich bißher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehalten</unclear>, ob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gichtigen</unclear>
